{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:36 2026-08-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:36 2026-08-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:36 2026-08-15 HKT</p><p>中環雲咸街與德己立街交界，今（15日)早上約8時， 一名白衫黑短褲男子在上址報案，指他途經上址時被兩名非洲裔男子毆打及搶劫，掠去其手提電話及銀包，兩匪得手後逃去。事主感頭痛。警員接報到場，發現事主身有酒氣，並與他在附近兜截疑人，惜無發現。事主左腳踭貼有膠布，沒有其他傷勢，暫毋須送院。警方正查看附近CCTV，追緝賊人。</p><img alt=\"白衫黑褲男事主在場協查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66d542015d344bc2564ca095a8c45a2e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_18_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"白衫黑褲男事主在場協查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf6b48c6a5bf77c5dcbd594391bbc50a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_18_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7196e96f10eb7e07a245b7087c04a72/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_21_08.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5eda7e96117317b4449fe221478e6c8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_21_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5aee28c59a1d6d76c82b552260222154/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_21_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場附近有CＣＴＶ。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8431089c27cdbe608ec61594735c5719/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_21_06.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49b7a58bcef76a510e86fa28af7633a4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_18_51.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事主左腳踭貼有膠布。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db6b81ce379b2fc3e9378217c2350ead/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-15_at_10_18_03_1_.jpeg\"/><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T02:43:59.381426+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}